tasks.description:
See docs/plans/cmufs7ek60001nm2x6d0bt2et/3-plan.md §2.3. New global/components/contact_profile.gd (ContactProfile, a Node):
- modes NONE / COLLISION / RAMMING / EXPLOSIVE;
- set_armed() toggles the ContactHitBox's monitorable and monitoring via set_deferred;
- signals contact_made(area: Area2D) and detonated(position: Vector2);
- EXPLOSIVE creates a one-physics-frame blast HitBox (layer 256, mask 128, CONTACT) using an accumulated counter, never create_timer. It detonates on contact while armed and on the owner's death while armed.
Wiring:
- BaseEnemy resolves a scene-authored profile or creates a default COLLISION one, the same pattern as DefenseProfile.
- BaseEnemy.suspend_ai() arms it.
- Every legacy enemy keeps today's behaviour. The Bonus Drone (no ContactHitBox) resolves cleanly.
Tests: new tests/unit/test_contact_profile.gd (§4 row, including the engine pin that arming while already overlapping a player hurtbox registers exactly one hit); extend test_base_enemy.gd.
